# OpenSky Network REST API Configuration
#
# IMPORTANT: OpenSky Network now exclusively uses OAuth2 Client Credentials for authenticated access.
# Legacy Basic Authentication (username/password) has been deprecated and is rejected.
#
# Cloud Deployment Note:
# OpenSky explicitly restricts or throttles unauthenticated requests from public cloud datacenters (AWS/Vercel).
# To query live aircraft from a cloud deployment like Vercel, set your OAuth2 client credentials below.
#
# To create an API client:
# 1. Sign up / Log into your account at https://opensky-network.org/
# 2. Go to your Account page > API Clients and create a client.
# 3. Enter the generated client_id and client_secret below.

OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here

# Local Development Server Port
PORT=5173
